# SQL migration files must be byte-identical on every checkout platform:
# their SHA256 checksum is load-bearing (docs/design/03-v1-alpha-foundation.md
# V1-04's tamper detection — internal/adapters/sqlite/migrations.go computes
# it from the embedded file bytes). Line-ending normalization on checkout
# would silently change that checksum per-platform, so it must never apply
# here regardless of a contributor's or CI runner's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sql text eol=lf
